  description: 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must be Special Summoned by its own
    effect, and cannot be Special Summoned by other ways. When a face-up monster
    you control is destroyed by a card effect and sent to the Graveyard (except during
    the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card from your hand. This card
    gains ATK and DEF equal to half your LP. Once per turn: You can target 1 Synchro
    Monster your opponent controls; equip that target to this card. This card gains
    ATK equal to the combined ATK of the monsters equipped to it by this effect.
    You can target 1 of these equipped monsters; Special Summon that target to your
    side of the field in Defense Position.'
